# Everything in this folder is shared with the team except what is listed here.
# The repo is private, so the only reasons to exclude something are size and the
# fact that it is regenerated rather than written by us.

# --- The virtualenv ---
# 7.5 GB of pip-installed packages, 19 of them over GitHub's 100 MB limit. Not our
# work: rebuild it with python3.11 -m venv, then install torch and `pip install -e software/`.
.venv/
.venv311/

# --- Over GitHub's 100 MB per-file hard limit ---
# best.pt, the trained model, is 139 MB. Send it to the team over group chat.
*.pt
*.onnx

# --- Written while the app runs, not work ---
# The annotated images and videos the app produces. Regenerated on the next run,
# and detected/ alone is ~100 MB of old output.
software/app/static/detected/
flask_session/
runs/
proof.jpg

# The upload folder is where demo uploads land, so it fills with whatever was tested
# that day. The four fixtures below are the exception: verify_model.py and
# bench_enhance.py run against them, and without them a fresh clone cannot reproduce
# starfish 0.83 / holothurian 0.78. URPC_test_video.mp4 is 84 MB and goes over chat.
software/app/upload/*
!software/app/upload/000013.jpg
!software/app/upload/003045.jpg
!software/app/upload/test_000080.jpg
!software/app/upload/test_000183.jpg

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# --- Editor and OS junk ---
.DS_Store
.idea/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
